# The shared libraries of every package of the native catalog (src/core/toolchain/natives-<subdir>.json), as the
# package holds them: one line per file below lib/ that is a shared library or a link to one.
#
#   <subdir> <package> <sha256 of the package file> <path>             a regular file
#   <subdir> <package> <sha256 of the package file> <path> -> <target>   a link, target relative to its directory
#
# Read by the unit test "every package of the native catalog holds a shared library ..." (native_catalog.zig):
# a catalog package without a regular shared library, or with a link to a file the package does not hold,
# fails it. The sha256 ties each line to the package it was read from, so a pin that moves needs its lines
# read again. Read them from the package file: unzip -p <file>.conda 'pkg-*' | zstd -dc | tar -tv
